sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Admin / Ops
    participant CP as Control Plane API
    participant DB as Rules DB
    participant BUS as Config Bus
    participant GW1 as Gateway 1
    participant GW2 as Gateway 2

    A->>CP: PUT /rules/plan_free<br/>{limit: 100, window: 60s, burst: 20}
    CP->>CP: validate rule (limit > 0)
    CP->>DB: persist rule v12
    CP->>BUS: publish rules_v12
    BUS-->>GW1: push rules_v12
    BUS-->>GW2: push rules_v12
    GW1->>GW1: refresh local rule cache
    GW2->>GW2: refresh local rule cache
    Note over GW1,GW2: New requests use updated limits immediately
